### REST Client — S11.2 Claude Code setup avanzado para Azure (BONUS).
### Estructura `.claude/` + permissions + CLAUDE.md + Azure skills.

@host = http://localhost:5123

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Estructura mínima: solo el core
POST {{host}}/setup/estructura
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Estructura completa: equipo con agents + skills + MCP
POST {{host}}/setup/estructura
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tieneAgentsCustom": true,
  "tieneSkillsPropios": true,
  "tieneSlashCommandsCustom": true,
  "quiereHooks": true,
  "usaMcpServers": true
}

### Settings con allow amplio (Critico) + sin deny destructivos (Alto)
POST {{host}}/setup/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allow": ["Bash(*)", "Write(**)"],
  "deny": [],
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
}

### Settings bien configurados
POST {{host}}/setup/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allow": ["Bash(dotnet *)", "Bash(az *)", "Read(**)", "Write(src/**)"],
  "deny": [
    "Bash(rm -rf *)",
    "Bash(az group delete *)",
    "Bash(az resource delete *)",
    "Bash(drop database *)",
    "Read(**/*.env)",
    "Read(**/*.pfx)",
    "Read(**/*.key)",
    "Read(**/local.settings.json)"
  ],
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
}

### CLAUDE.md vago (puntuación baja)
POST {{host}}/setup/claudemd
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contenido": "# Mi proyecto\n\nUna app." }

### CLAUDE.md bien estructurado (puntuación alta)
POST {{host}}/setup/claudemd
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contenido": "# Proyecto Ventas\n\n## Stack\n- .NET 8 con Cosmos DB y Azure Functions\n- Service Bus y Key Vault\n\n## Convenciones\n- async/await siempre\n- ILogger con logging estructurado\n- Records para DTOs\n\n## Comandos\n- dotnet build\n- dotnet test\n- az deployment group create\n\n## Arquitectura\nVer docs/architecture.md.\n\n## No tocar sin preguntar\n- infrastructure/modules/rbac.bicep (requiere review del lead)" }

### CLAUDE.md con anti-pattern: secreto literal
POST {{host}}/setup/claudemd
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contenido": "# Proyecto\n\n## Stack\n.NET 8.\n\nConnection string: Server=tcp:sql.db;Password=secret123;" }

### Los 20 skills del Azure Skills Plugin (slide 16)
GET {{host}}/setup/azure-skills

### Plan completo
POST {{host}}/setup/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "equipo": {
    "tieneAgentsCustom": true,
    "tieneSkillsPropios": true,
    "quiereHooks": true,
    "usaMcpServers": true
  },
  "settings": {
    "allow": ["Bash(dotnet *)", "Read(**)", "Write(src/**)"],
    "deny": [
      "Bash(rm -rf *)",
      "Bash(az group delete *)",
      "Bash(az resource delete *)",
      "Bash(drop database *)",
      "Read(**/*.env)",
      "Read(**/*.pfx)",
      "Read(**/*.key)",
      "Read(**/local.settings.json)"
    ],
    "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
  },
  "claudeMdContenido": "# Proyecto\n## Stack\n.NET 8 con Cosmos DB\n## Convenciones\nasync/await + ILogger\n## Comandos\ndotnet build\n## No tocar sin preguntar\nrbac.bicep"
}
